				<wikidot:authorName>WrongJohnSilver</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2000367</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I have it confirmed from <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/procyonlotor" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=778357&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1531421937" alt="ProcyonLotor" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=778357)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/procyonlotor" >ProcyonLotor</a></span> that people can make additions to this list now and it won't affect their rights to post 4000 contest entries, and the vote count that matters is the one on the main SCP page (which isn't a collab).</p> <p>So, yes, it's open now. Feel free to add your entries!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
